btn"><button>Send Inquiry</button></div></div><div class="sc-34a5360a-0 chJRqf"><h2 class="sc-c6d82cff-0 cPAmJ product-details-title">Product Specifications</h2><table class="spec-table"><tbody><tr><td>Color</td><td>Purple</td></tr><tr><td>Dosage</td><td>500mg</td></tr><tr><td>Features</td><td>Pain relief, Fever reduction, Headache treatment, Muscle pain relief, Dosage flexibility</td></tr><tr><td>Ingredients</td><td>Paracetamol</td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturer</td><td>GlaxoSmithKline</td></tr><tr><td>Packaging</td><td>Blister pack</td></tr><tr><td>Shape</td><td>Round</td></tr><tr><td>Tablets</td><td>45</td></tr><tr><td>Feature</td><td>mild analgesic and antipyretic</td></tr><tr><td>Composition</td><td>Paracetamol</td></tr><tr><td>Appearance</td><td>Tablets</td></tr><tr><td>Product Type</td><td>Organic Medicine</td></tr><tr><td>Physical Form</td><td>Tablets</td></tr><tr><td>Treatments &amp; Functions</td><td>Other Functions</td></tr><tr><td>Recommended For</td><td>Other Health Issues</td></tr><tr><td>Age Group</td><td>Adult</td></tr><tr><td>Dosage Guidelines</td><td>With Warm Milk</td></tr><tr><td>Quantity</td><td>15x3x15 Pieces</td></tr><tr><td>Storage Instructions</td><td>Cool and dry place</td></tr><tr><td>Payment Terms</td><td>Telegraphic Transfer (T/T), Cash in Advance (CID), Cash Advance (CA)</td></tr><tr><td>Supply Ability</td><td>100 Per Day</td></tr><tr><td>Delivery Time</td><td>3-4 Days</td></tr><tr><td>Sample Policy</td><td>Contact us for information regarding our sample policy</td></tr><tr><td>Packaging Details</td><td>Box packaging</td></tr><tr><td>Main Export Market(s)</td><td>Asia</td></tr><tr><td>Main Domestic Market</td><td>Odisha</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="about-product"><h2 class="sc-c6d82cff-0 sNMMF title">Product Overview</h2><p class="sc-c6d82cff-0 ljgSQv mb-3">Key Features</p><div class="sc-c6d82cff-0 hEKoNt overflow-x seo-content"><div>Paracetamol 500mg Tablet relieves pain and fever by suppressing the generation of certain chemical messengers that cause fever and pain. It can be used to treat headaches, migraines, nerve pain, toothaches, sore throats, period (menstrual) issues, arthritis, muscle aches, and the common cold. The pain reliever paracetamol 500mg Tablet can be used alone or in combination with other drugs. You should take it on a regular basis as advised by your doctor. If you don't want to upset your stomach, it's best to take it with food. Take no more than the recommended dose, and do not take it for longer than suggested.</div></div></div><h2 class="sc-c6d82cff-0 sNMMF coy-details-title">Company Details</h2><div class="sc-c6d82cff-0 hEKoFN overflow-x seo-content"><div>Registered in <strong>2018</strong>, <strong>Vijaya Laxmi Medical & General Store</strong> has made a name for itself in the list of top suppliers of Pain Relief Drugs & Medicines in India. The supplier company is located in Koraput, Odisha, and is one of the leading sellers of listed products.<br />Vijaya Laxmi Medical & General Store is listed in Trade India's list of verified sellers offering supreme quality of Paracetamol Tablets 500 Mg, 15x10x15 Tablets, etc. Buy Pain Relief Drugs & Medicines in bulk from us for the best quality products and service.</div></div><div class="business-details"><div class="detail-row"><div class="info-block"><span class="color-bg-icon d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20px" height="20px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#DB6818" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"></path></svg></span><div class="info-rt"><p class="sc-c6d82cff-0 ZxFId">Business Type</p><p class="sc-c6d82cff-0 fioeCJ">Distributor, Supplier</p></div></div><div class="info-block"><span class="color-bg-icon d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20px" he